cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use these checks, please cite the software and the accompanying paper."
type: software
version: "1.0.0"
doi: "10.5281/zenodo.24116313"
date-released: "2026-11-10"
license: "MIT"
title: "Exact-arithmetic checks for the GLR conjecture for C4 x C4"
authors:
  - given-names: "Raphael"
    family-names: "Reinauer"
repository-code: "https://github.com/raphaelreinauer/glr-c4xc4-checks"
url: "https://github.com/raphaelreinauer/glr-c4xc4-checks"
abstract: >-
  Six standalone Python scripts accompanying Appendix A of the paper
  The Gromov-Lawson-Rosenberg Conjecture for the group Z/4 x Z/4.
  The scripts check exact eta matrices, Smith forms, Adams spectral-sequence
  calculations, rational generating-function identities, and mixed
  spin-index/Gysin computations. They supplement the written proofs;
  finite-range checks are distinguished from all-parameter identities.
keywords:
  - positive scalar curvature
  - Gromov-Lawson-Rosenberg conjecture
  - eta invariants
  - Smith normal form
  - real connective K-homology
